{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726940/extras/d6a587f507769344c6ef81e8c150cbc3.poster.avif?t=1757627986\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726940/extras/d6a587f507769344c6ef81e8c150cbc3.webm?t=1757627986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726940/extras/d6a587f507769344c6ef81e8c150cbc3.mp4?t=1757627986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pickles in a jar, nerves on edge!</strong><br>Pickle Panic is a physics-based co-op platform/party game where you and your team steer pickles inside a glass jar through courses full of swinging hammers, falling boulders, and rotating columns. The goal is simple: <strong>reach the finish without breaking the jar.</strong> It\u2019s easy to pick up, but mastering it together takes real coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone on the team affects the jar\u2019s balance and speed. Lean, push, and brake; share momentum to cross bridges, slopes, and wild contraptions. <strong>Dynamic damage</strong> based on impact speed will crack the jar; push too hard and you\u2019ll all <strong>respawn at the last checkpoint.</strong> Communication is key\u2014panic guaranteed!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1\u20134 player online co-op</strong> (solo-friendly as well)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-driven jar control:</strong> weight, friction, momentum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied hazards:</strong> swinging hammers, falling rocks, rotating columns, moving platforms, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breakable jar &amp; health system:</strong> speed/impact-based damage with smart checkpoints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team-first design:</strong> easy to learn, master together\u2014chaos turns into comedy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable courses</strong> plus cosmetics you unlock as you progress</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your friends and get that jar to the finish line without cracking. <strong>Add Pickle Panic to your wishlist!</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3726940?t=1757627986","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3726940?t=1757627986","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726940/3e7f31042c558b8233995dec584f5603efa9d535/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757627986","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726940/3e7f31042c558b8233995dec584f5603efa9d535/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757627986","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726940/extras/d6a587f507769344c6ef81e8c150cbc3.poster.avif?t=1757627986\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726940/extras/d6a587f507769344c6ef81e8c150cbc3.webm?t=1757627986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726940/extras/d6a587f507769344c6ef81e8c150cbc3.mp4?t=1757627986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pickles in a jar, nerves on edge!</strong><br>Pickle Panic is a physics-based co-op platform/party game where you and your team steer pickles inside a glass jar through courses full of swinging hammers, falling boulders, and rotating columns. The goal is simple: <strong>reach the finish without breaking the jar.</strong> It\u2019s easy to pick up, but mastering it together takes real coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone on the team affects the jar\u2019s balance and speed. Lean, push, and brake; share momentum to cross bridges, slopes, and wild contraptions. <strong>Dynamic damage</strong> based on impact speed will crack the jar; push too hard and you\u2019ll all <strong>respawn at the last checkpoint.</strong> Communication is key\u2014panic guaranteed!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1\u20134 player online co-op</strong> (solo-friendly as well)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-driven jar control:</strong> weight, friction, momentum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied hazards:</strong> swinging hammers, falling rocks, rotating columns, moving platforms, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breakable jar &amp; health system:</strong> speed/impact-based damage with smart checkpoints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team-first design:</strong> easy to learn, master together\u2014chaos turns into comedy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable courses</strong> plus cosmetics you unlock as you progress</p></li></ul><p cla